codex
The bounded trace revealed the decisive mismatch: this semantics desugars `While` to its internal `#while` continuation and loops back to `#while`, not the surface AST node. The invariant must therefore be stated at that semantic cutpoint. I’m correcting the claim’s left side; this should enable circularity after one iteration instead of unrolling forever.
apply patch
